{"3368280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interstellar Together", "steam_appid": 3368280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong> Step into the role of spaceship crew members awakening from stasis, only to discover your first mission isn’t repairing the ship—it’s repairing your teamwork. This sci-fi cooperative puzzle game challenges you and your partner to solve asymmetric puzzles that test your communication, logical thinking, and problem-solving skills. With each task completed, you inch closer to proving yourselves as the ultimate crew duo, ready for the challenges of deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetrical Gameplay:</strong> Separated by a barrier, neither player has the full picture. You’ll need to describe what you see, share information, and coordinate carefully to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sci-Fi Setting:</strong> Explore a futuristic training facility aboard a spaceship, filled with sleek, immersive environments designed to sharpen your crew’s synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Puzzles:</strong> Face a variety of challenges, from logical riddles to memory tests, dexterity trials, and complex mechanical repairs. Each puzzle requires unique solutions that push your teamwork to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Challenge:</strong> Start with simple tasks to ease into communication before taking on intricate, multi-step puzzles designed to test your collaboration under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Design:</strong> With intuitive controls and a clear focus on communication, the game ensures players of all experience levels can join the fun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you and your partner emerge as 